<i>Peer Gynt "Morning"</i>

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:05.640
Ahh, I slept so well.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.470
Oh my...

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:12.840
You! You! You!

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.900
You! You! You!

