<i>X Day of X Month
A Certain Live Music Club in Tokyo</i>

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.070
<i>Idol Producer PipiP...</i>

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:52.070
PipiP

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:48.990
<i>PipiP has sent numerous
performers out into the world.</i>

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:52.480
<i>The focus of her efforts right now,</i>

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:56.570
<i>is her newest discovery, 
Pop-chin with the Tame Monkeys.</i>

00:02:54.560 --> 00:03:01.560
Pop-chin with
the Tame Monkeys.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:58.610
Hey! Not you again!

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:01.890
- Give us a break!
- Enough, get off the stage!

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:04.080
Hey!

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.230
<i>Pop-chin with
 the Tame Monkeys</i>

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.770
Listen, Pop-chin, will you shape up?!

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:15.670
We're idols!
Don't you know that?!

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:19.420
Tell her too, Producer!

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:24.140
Pop-chin, I think you should 
lose the cigarettes.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:34.630
Oh, good girl!
You're special, after all.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.450
Err...

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.370
A light! Give her a light!

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:42.890
- Yes!
- Right!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:48.890
Huh? Who're you shooting?
I'm not on display here.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:53.740
Pop-chan, it's for television.
They're doing a story.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:58.040
I'm going to do my best again today!

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.370
<i>We asked PipiP.</i>

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.760
<i>Why don't you lecture Pop-chin?</i>

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:11.650
She's a vessel who will
reach the pinnacle.

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:29.370
If you wanna get it,
come at me now!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.670
You two are holding Pop-chin back.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:40.920
<i>In her search to find the best
counterbalance for her star</i>

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:44.510
<i>she kept switching the members
of the Tame Monkeys.</i>

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:50.400
<i>However, try as she might,
PipiP was not satisfied with any of them.</i>

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:56.650
<i>Finally, PipiP came to a certain conclusion.</i>

00:04:57.190 --> 00:05:00.620
<i>The plan to clone lots of Pop-chins</i>

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.740
<i>What is the plan to clone
lots of Pop-chins?</i>

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:17.060
<i>And the plan was put into action.</i>

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:23.770
<i>Pop-chins were manufactured
with unceasing speed in a factory.</i>

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:30.850
<i>In time, there were so many,
they threatened man's existence.</i>

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:47.220
<i>We asked PipiP.</i>

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:54.070
<i>Is this the ideal world
that you envisioned?</i>

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:56.490
I guess you could say that.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:19.670
<i>The Documentary
~On the Other Side of an Idol's Dream~</i>

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:19.670
<i>The End</i>

